<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?>
<LanguageData>
  <!--EN: Craft janissary armor, light powered armor that’s commonly used by imperial recon troops. Note that these also require advanced components.-->
  <VFEE_JanissaryGear.description>制作禁卫军盔甲，这是帝国侦察部队常用的轻型动力盔甲。请注意，这些也需要高级组件。</VFEE_JanissaryGear.description>
  <VFEE_JanissaryGear.generalRules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: subject->elite warfare engineering-->
    <li>subject-&gt;精英战争工程</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->designed armor that blended ancient warrior traditions with the pinnacle of modern defense technology-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;设计的盔甲融合了古代武士传统与现代防御技术的巅峰</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->equipped scouts with gear that turned the tide of covert operations-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;为侦察兵配备扭转秘密行动潮流的装备</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->created a legacy of warriors feared for both their prowess and their unparalleled equipment-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;创造了一批因其英勇和无与伦比的装备而令人畏惧的战士遗产</li>
    <!--EN: subject_gerund->forging the future of military attire-->
    <li>subject_gerund-&gt;打造 军事 服装的未来</li>
  </VFEE_JanissaryGear.generalRules.rulesStrings>
  <!--EN: janissary gear-->
  <VFEE_JanissaryGear.label>禁卫军装备</VFEE_JanissaryGear.label>
  <!--EN: Build noble decorations like royal rugs, mirrors, grand chairs, imperial slabs, candelabras, and more.-->
  <VFEE_NobleDecorations.description>建造高贵的装饰品，如皇家地毯、镜子、豪华椅子、皇家石板、烛台等。</VFEE_NobleDecorations.description>
  <VFEE_NobleDecorations.generalRules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: subject->aristocratic elegance-->
    <li>subject-&gt;贵族优雅</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->designed living spaces fit for kings and queens-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;为国王和王后设计的居住空间</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->brought beauty and luxury to the stark lives of the nobility-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;为贵族的严酷生活带来美丽和奢华</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->set the standards for opulence in decor that lasted centuries-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;树立了延续几个世纪的奢华装饰标准</li>
    <!--EN: subject_gerund->elevating interiors to royal standards-->
    <li>subject_gerund-&gt;将内饰提升至皇家标准</li>
  </VFEE_NobleDecorations.generalRules.rulesStrings>
  <!--EN: noble decorations-->
  <VFEE_NobleDecorations.label>高贵的装饰品</VFEE_NobleDecorations.label>
  <!--EN: Craft the pipe organs, an incredibly advanced and intricate stationary musical instrument.-->
  <VFEE_PipeOrgans.description>制作管风琴，这是一种极其先进且复杂的固定乐器。</VFEE_PipeOrgans.description>
  <VFEE_PipeOrgans.generalRules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: subject->musical mastery-->
    <li>subject-&gt;音乐掌握</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->crafted instruments that echoed through cathedrals and concert halls alike-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;精心制作的乐器在大教堂和音乐厅中回响</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->combined ancient lore with modern acoustics to create a symphony of sound-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;将古代传说与现代声学相结合，创造出一首声音交响乐</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->invented an organ with pipes that mimicked the voice of the divine-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;发明了一种模仿神的声音的管风琴</li>
    <!--EN: subject_gerund->harmonizing craftsmanship and artistry-->
    <li>subject_gerund-&gt;协调工艺与艺术</li>
  </VFEE_PipeOrgans.generalRules.rulesStrings>
  <!--EN: pipe organs-->
  <VFEE_PipeOrgans.label>管风琴</VFEE_PipeOrgans.label>
  <!--EN: Construct the most grand, most beautiful stellic throne for your high ranking nobility.-->
  <VFEE_StellicThrone.description>为你的高级贵族建造最宏伟、最美丽的星辰王座。</VFEE_StellicThrone.description>
  <VFEE_StellicThrone.generalRules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: subject->regal craftsmanship-->
    <li>subject-&gt;富丽堂皇的工艺</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->forged a throne from the heart of a fallen star, symbolizing eternal rule-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;用一颗陨落的星辰之心铸造了王座，象征着永恒的统治</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->crafted not just a seat, but a legacy, ensuring the ruler's presence is felt even in absence-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;精心打造的不仅仅是一个座位，更是一份遗产，确保即使在统治者缺席的情况下也能感受到统治者的存在</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->merged the art of smithing with celestial materials to create a throne worthy of legends-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;将锻造艺术与天体材料相结合，创造了一个值得传奇的王座</li>
    <!--EN: subject_gerund->creating the pinnacle of nobility's power-->
    <li>subject_gerund-&gt;创造贵族权力的顶峰</li>
  </VFEE_StellicThrone.generalRules.rulesStrings>
  <!--EN: stellic throne-->
  <VFEE_StellicThrone.label>星辰王座</VFEE_StellicThrone.label>
</LanguageData>
